                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
                        "entry_id": "51af9b6c-bea4-3db4-a133-5b00d3dc31a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "naukowiec zajmujący się badaniem organizmów kopalnych"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d636b702-feea-46f8-8f1e-ef7851e4aef4",
                                "sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
                                "text": "Amerykańscy i rumuńscy paleontolodzy odkryli w Rumunii szczątki nieznanego dotychczas dinozaura, który przypomina mięsożernego welociraptora."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6d324d6-ad77-4f38-9b8d-ecbe41579690",
                                "sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
                                "text": "Badaniem pradawnych organizmów zajmują się paleontolodzy, genetycy oraz ewolucjoniści."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fdad95b3-840c-420c-9814-745d33a04979",
                        "source_entry_id": "51af9b6c-bea4-3db4-a133-5b00d3dc31a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
                        "target_lang_word": "paleontologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paleontologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2039c432-d69b-33a3-8809-d8fcca0aa9a7",
                                        "entry_id": "1fa8e8b2-7e09-3c23-b5d4-84e7bc609715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who studies paleontology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39e58a20-f15d-4933-abac-cb162ca3ee30",
                                                "sense_id": "2039c432-d69b-33a3-8809-d8fcca0aa9a7",
                                                "text": "An alternative approach is to break down cultures into ab-\n stract elements and to establish, between elements of the same\n type in different cultures, rather than between cultures themselves,\n the same kind of relationships of historical descent and progressive\n differentiation which the paleontologist sees in the evolution of\n species."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "871a0cf9-32c3-4108-ac8b-4c476e93e38d",
                                                "sense_id": "2039c432-d69b-33a3-8809-d8fcca0aa9a7",
                                                "text": "In the late nineteenth century, paleontologists began to catalog the many curious correspondences exhibited by fossils gathered on different continents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "129ff7a5-a02d-4cc2-b64a-56c4799d24fe",
                        "source_entry_id": "51af9b6c-bea4-3db4-a133-5b00d3dc31a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
                        "target_lang_word": "paleontolog",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paleontolog",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be4c84c7-462e-38c6-920a-595d49e205f9",
                                        "entry_id": "4e6b06de-410d-38d4-ac74-ac49a6a06353",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "vědec zabývající se vymřelými organismy z prehistorie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fdaf6793-8905-4849-87b9-b693d3cc1861",
                        "source_entry_id": "51af9b6c-bea4-3db4-a133-5b00d3dc31a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
                        "target_lang_word": "paléontologiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paléontologiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27c8376d-e207-370c-9cc0-a7b41ab3474a",
                                        "entry_id": "63cb679d-86d4-3821-8e0e-95de540c1cef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne versée dans la paléontologie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cd00b3b-e282-4ec2-a8e5-5eeb4cd5f02b",
                                                "sense_id": "27c8376d-e207-370c-9cc0-a7b41ab3474a",
                                                "text": "Quant aux vrais brachiopodes et à leur classement particulier, un paléontologiste anglais qui s’en est occupé beaucoup plus spécialement et un paléontologiste français dont nous avons déjà cité les travaux nous dispensent de nous étendre davantage à leur égard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "342fdf6d-2932-426b-a067-5be3ecf344d1",
                                                "sense_id": "27c8376d-e207-370c-9cc0-a7b41ab3474a",
                                                "text": "Depuis cet acte de foi, les opinions se sont à nouveau éparpillées, faisant surtout plonger le phylum des Oréopithecidae (dont on a reconnu des formes dans le miocène d’Afrique orientale) au plus profond des origines catarrhiniennes; c'est une solution d'attente confortable que connaissent (bien) les paléontologistes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e29cb33c-3025-4625-b931-d36e509a1f92",
                        "source_entry_id": "51af9b6c-bea4-3db4-a133-5b00d3dc31a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5d0f926-4554-31b2-8e99-f76388262b95",
